WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
A huge carthorse hauls stone up a slope.

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.790
Season after season, the loads pile up.

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.830
Boxer is stronger than any other animal.

4
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.440
His answer to every problem: work harder.

5
00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:14.800
Chapter 7.

6
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.750
Three dogs rush at him.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.330
He pins one down with a single hoof.

8
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.140
Then he lets it go.

9
00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.690
A gate stands open.

10
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.860
He turns back to his load.

11
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.260
So why doesn't the
strongest animal resist?

12
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:31.290
In this mission, you'll
meet Boxer properly:

13
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.290
gentle, admired, the
hardest worker on the farm.

14
00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.830
You'll follow his trust
as it's put under strain,

15
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.570
chapter by chapter.

16
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.340
And you'll compare him with
the other working animals:

17
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.060
a mare, a donkey, the hens.

18
00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:49.390
Your mission: explain why the
strongest animal doesn't resist.
